      "estleg:versionText": "1 (1) Kui koera peetakse puuris või muus selletaolises ruumis, peab ruumi pindala olenevalt looma suurusest olema vähemalt järgmine: <table class=\"data\"> <tbody><tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"border: inset 1.0pt; padding-top: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-right: .75pt; border-left: none\"> <p align=\"center\"> Koerte arv </p> </td> <td colspan=\"6\" style=\"border: inset 1.0pt; padding-top: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; border-right: none; padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt\"> <p align=\"center\"> Pindala (m²)<br/>Koera (koerte) keskmine kaal </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt; padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt\"> <p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\"> Kuni 5 kg </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt; padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt\"> <p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\"> kuni 10 kg </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt; padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt\"> <p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\"> kuni 20 kg </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt; padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt\"> <p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\"> kuni 30 kg </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt; padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt\"> <p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\"> kuni 40 kg </p> </td> <td style=\"border: inset 1.0pt; padding-top: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; border-right: none; padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt\"> <p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\"> kuni 50 kg<br/>ja rohkem </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"border: inset 1.0pt; padding-top: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-right: .75pt; border-left: none\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\"> 1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-top: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-right: .75pt\" valign=\"to