      "estleg:versionText": "1 (1) Puurilinnu pidamise puuri mõõtmed peavad olenevalt linnu suurusest olema vähemalt järgmised: <table class=\"data\" style=\"width: 375.0pt\"> <tbody><tr> <td style=\"border: inset 1.0pt; padding-top: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-right: .75pt; border-left: none\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\"> <span><font color=\"black\">Linnu pikkus (cm) mõõdetuna linnu nokast</font></span> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-top: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-right: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\"> <span><font color=\"black\">Pindala ühe linnu kohta (m²)</font></span> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-top: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-right: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\"> <span><font color=\"black\">Iga järgneva linnu kohta lisandub (m²)</font></span> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-top: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-right: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\"> <span><font color=\"black\">Lühima külje pikkus (m)</font></span> </p> </td> <td style=\"border: inset 1.0pt; padding-top: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; border-right: none; padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\"> <span><font color=\"black\">Kõrgus (m)</font></span> </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"border: inset 1.0pt; padding-top: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-right: .75pt; border-left: none\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\"> Alla 16 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-top: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-right: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\"> 0,31 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-top: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-right: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\" class=\"M